1. DESCRIPTION OF SOFTWARE\par
\par
Template Builder is a Command-Line Interface (CLI) tool that allows users to create custom project templates from YAML configuration files. The tool generates ready-made project structures by creating folders, generating files, and collecting user input through interactive CLI prompts defined in YAML files.\par
\par
The Software enables users to:\par
- Define project templates using YAML configuration files\par
- Generate project structures automatically\par
- Create files and folders based on template definitions\par
- Collect user input through interactive prompts\par
- Use template variables and functions for dynamic content generation\par
